==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*kupla}}, probably from {{inh|fi|fiu-pro|*kupla}}. Related to {{cog|et|kubel}}, {{cog|krl|kupla}}, {{cog|olo|kubl}} and probably {{cog|smn|koble||roe pouch}}, {{cog|chm|tr=kuwōl}} and {{cog|mns|tr=kɛ̮wl-|||to swim, to float}}, possibly also {{cog|hu|hólyag||bladder}}.

